        "cooked": "<p>We finally returned to SC…</p>\n<p>2 characters come forward, 2 new, and a third coming forward when the player manages to get back. (We didn’t get enough notice this week.)<br>\n3 of the four players from last time were present, a new to SC 4th was also  in.</p>\n<p>I log my sessions over on RPGG; if people want, I’ll crosspost here, otherwise, I’ll just link to the entries.<br>\nThis week was “School of Rox” Villain series “The Doorman Issue <span class=\"hashtag\">#31</span>”</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/80b9f52677b676f7051587971ec1d3161c7da11b.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n      <a href=\"https://rpggeek.com/geeklist/286640/item/8345936#item8345936\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">rpggeek.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/dbba09318e1a751da8d941f0fdb3328c7c1d39d2_2_690x362.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/dbba09318e1a751da8d941f0fdb3328c7c1d39d2_2_690x362.png, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/dbba09318e1a751da8d941f0fdb3328c7c1d39d2_2_1035x543.png 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dbba09318e1a751da8d941f0fdb3328c7c1d39d2.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/dbba09318e1a751da8d941f0fdb3328c7c1d39d2_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://rpggeek.com/geeklist/286640/item/8345936#item8345936\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">21 June 2021: How did your RPG session(s) go this week? | RPGGeek</a></h3>\n\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \